{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If an object is detected, approach and take it, perform task, move or scan area.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Action ID = MoveToAnotherLocation    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = PerformTask    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    />",
